# rasayan — src/pi3k.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's PI3K/Akt/mTOR tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 11 unit tests of `pi3k.rs` and the 2 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only the pathway, as
# they are written; tests/golden/pi3k.tsv checks every method, single tick and trajectory besides. Beyond them: the
# trace event and every codec's round trip.

